{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"network time series context window network time series context window","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md","fileName":"Network Time-Series Context Window.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Network Time-Series Context Window","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Network Monitoring and Remediation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Network Monitoring and Remediation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"network time series context window network time series context window","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md","fileName":"Network Time-Series Context Window.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Network Time-Series Context Window","heading":"Network Time-Series Context Window","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A network time-series context window contains ordered measurements over a declared collection period and interval, such as hourly bandwidth utilization across seven days. It exposes trend, repetition, and recent change that a single health snapshot cannot show.\n\nThe window must preserve missing samples and timestamps because a bare number sequence can hide collection gaps. Its length should match the forecast horizon and operating cycle under study. Longer context is not automatically better if it mixes obsolete behavior with the current regime.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Network Monitoring and Remediation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"network time series context window network time series context window","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Network Time-Series Context Window.md","fileName":"Network Time-Series Context Window.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Network Time-Series Context Window","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Network Monitoring and Remediation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}